rce":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":302,"end":369,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-90c90de2e5295ba7ea62","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"九年，暂出，到武安毛城中。会太祖破邺，遂围毛城。城破，执邵等辈十余人，皆当斩","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":37,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-b9ac1e759b4e03807094","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"然私谓其妻子曰：‘公治性度犹如故也！以吾观之，终当败灭。但不知我久当坐之不邪？将逮汝曹耳","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":370,"end":414,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-c6f758a98815db6f7d8d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"二岁，病亡","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":234,"end":239,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-c9ec8d7dad0d8fc74924","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"邵没之后，十余年间，愚为兖州刺史，果与王凌谋废立，家属诛灭","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":416,"end":445,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-eb47a8df9a68937ff9c4","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"邵子华，时为弘农郡丞，以属疏，得不坐","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":446,"end":464,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q2-cd7cf5c8e25e60db7738","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"“令狐邵字孔叔。父仕汉，为乌丸校尉。建安初，袁氏在冀州，邵去本郡，家居邺。九年，暂出，到武安毛城中。会太祖破邺，遂围毛城。城破，执邵等辈十余人，皆当斩。太祖阅见之，疑其衣冠也；问其祖考，而识其父，乃解放。署军谋掾，仍历宰守，后徙丞相主簿，出为弘农太守。所在清如冰雪，妻子希至官省。举善而教，恕以待人；不好狱讼，与下无忌。是时，郡无知经者。乃历问诸吏，有欲远行就师，辄假遣，令诣河东，就乐详学经；粗明乃还，因设文学。由是弘农学业转兴。至黄初初，征拜羽林郎；迁虎贲中郎将，二岁，病亡。始，邵族子愚，为白衣时，常有高志。众人谓愚必荣令狐氏，而邵独以为：‘愚性倜傥，不修德而愿大，必灭我宗！’愚闻邵言，其心不平。及邵为虎贲郎将，而愚仕进已多所更历，所在有名称。愚见邵，因从容言次，微激之曰：‘先时闻大人谓愚为不继，愚今竟云何邪？’邵熟视，而不答也。然私谓其妻子曰：‘公治性度犹如故也！以吾观之，终当败灭。但不知我久当坐之不邪？将逮汝曹耳！’邵没之后，十余年间，愚为兖州刺史，果与王凌谋废立，家属诛灭。邵子华，时为弘农郡丞，以属疏，得不坐。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":0,"end":466,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
